## When implementing a priority

1. Prisma model + relations + `db.ts` stale guard
2. `src/lib/<module>/` + `src/types/`
3. API routes with existing `require-*` session helpers
4. Dashboard pages + client components
5. Module doc + `CHANGELOG` + version bump
6. `npm run build` must pass

